{"id":"16a1ffeeec4f6ecf","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-position-slices.md","title":"有类型位置的切片、前缀和模式","display":"df-position-slices — 有类型位置的切片、前缀和模式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-position-slices","aliases":["56-df-position-slices"],"display":"df-position-slices — 有类型位置的切片、前缀和模式","depends_on":["[[56-df-typed-term-positions]]"],"source_section":"§8.6.2 Definition 8.6.21; Example 8.6.22","source_printed_pages":"395","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-path-coding-local"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-position-slices"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-position-slices</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-position-slices — 有类型位置的切片、前缀和模式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"450432a0e779ee1f\" href=\"?note=450432a0e779ee1f\" title=\"56-df-typed-term-positions\">56-df-typed-term-positions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.6.2 Definition 8.6.21; Example 8.6.22"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"395"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-path-coding-local"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\operatorname{TPos},E,V,\\operatorname{Adj},\\operatorname{Bd},\\sqsubseteq\">\\(T,\\operatorname{TPos},E,V,\\operatorname{Adj},\\operatorname{Bd},\\sqsubseteq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"450432a0e779ee1f\" href=\"?note=450432a0e779ee1f\" title=\"56-df-typed-term-positions\">56-df-typed-term-positions</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\">\\(P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\)</span>；有限位置路径允许零条边，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z_0,\\ldots,z_n\">\\(z_0,\\ldots,z_n\\)</span> 为位置序列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Path}_s(P,z,w)\\iff\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(z_0,\\ldots,z_n)\\in P^{n+1}\\;\n\\bigl(z_0=z\\land z_n=w\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;(z_j,z_{j+1})\\in\\operatorname{Adj}_s\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Path}_s(P,z,w)\\iff\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(z_0,\\ldots,z_n)\\in P^{n+1}\\;\n\\bigl(z_0=z\\land z_n=w\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;(z_j,z_{j+1})\\in\\operatorname{Adj}_s\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Slice}_s(P)\\iff\\forall z,w\\in P\\;\\operatorname{Path}_s(P,z,w).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Slice}_s(P)\\iff\\forall z,w\\in P\\;\\operatorname{Path}_s(P,z,w).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prefix}_s(P)\\iff\n\\bigl(\\forall w\\in P\\;\\forall z\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\;(z\\sqsubseteq_s w\\Rightarrow z\\in P)\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{Bd}_s(P)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\times\\{1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Prefix}_s(P)\\iff\n\\bigl(\\forall w\\in P\\;\\forall z\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\;(z\\sqsubseteq_s w\\Rightarrow z\\in P)\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{Bd}_s(P)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\times\\{1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pattern}_s(P)\\iff\n\\operatorname{Slice}_s(P)\\land E(\\epsilon)\\notin P\\land\n\\operatorname{Bd}_s(P)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\times\\{1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pattern}_s(P)\\iff\n\\operatorname{Slice}_s(P)\\land E(\\epsilon)\\notin P\\land\n\\operatorname{Bd}_s(P)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\times\\{1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空集同时满足三种谓词。非空前缀包含根边；模式排除根边。边界必须是顶点的条件排除了只包含一条边的集合，把“沿树连通”和“可作为项的模式或上下文”区分开。这里给出路径见证的有限序列编码；不要求路径无环，也不要求从根出发。前缀的向下闭合已保证连通性，故不额外写重复的Slice条件。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的Terese本地DjVu，印刷第395页。定义和空集边界已经逐项与原文比对；未作机器证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-typed-term-positions","status":"resolved","id":"450432a0e779ee1f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-typed-term-positions]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-typed-term-positions","status":"resolved","id":"450432a0e779ee1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,\\operatorname{TPos},E,V,\\operatorname{Adj},\\operatorname{Bd},\\sqsubseteq$ 见 [[56-df-typed-term-positions]]。$s\\in T$，$P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(s)$；有限位置路径允许零条边，$z_0,\\ldots,z_n$ 为位置序列。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,\\operatorname{TPos},E,V,\\operatorname{Adj},\\operatorname{Bd},\\sqsubseteq","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"z_0,\\ldots,z_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Path}_s(P,z,w)\\iff\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(z_0,\\ldots,z_n)\\in P^{n+1}\\;\n\\bigl(z_0=z\\land z_n=w\\land\\forall j<n\\;(z_j,z_{j+1})\\in\\operatorname{Adj}_s\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Slice}_s(P)\\iff\\forall z,w\\in P\\;\\operatorname{Path}_s(P,z,w).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prefix}_s(P)\\iff\n\\bigl(\\forall w\\in P\\;\\forall z\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\;(z\\sqsubseteq_s w\\Rightarrow z\\in P)\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{Bd}_s(P)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\times\\{1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pattern}_s(P)\\iff\n\\operatorname{Slice}_s(P)\\land E(\\epsilon)\\notin P\\land\n\\operatorname{Bd}_s(P)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\times\\{1\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1969,"backlinks":[{"id":"b6aaae6fd581d4f1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,T,R,\\operatorname{Step}_R$ 见 [[56-df-redex-occurrence]]，这里 $\\mathcal V$ 实例化该上游的变量集 $V$，与位置构造器 $V(p)$ 区分。有类型位置与模式谓词见 [[56-df-position-slices]]；子项截取见 [[56-df-subterm]]。$\\operatorname{FPos}$ 独立定义在整个项集 $T$ 上。涉及 $\\operatorname{RPat}_R$ 的各式局部取 $a=(s,(p,l,r),t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R$，其定义域是具体步集；它只依赖源项中的位置和左项。"},{"id":"dbeb02768e341bce","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$\\Pi,\\Xi\\in\\mathcal P_R$，$T(\\Pi)=S(\\Xi)$；$P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(T(\\Xi))$ 且 $\\operatorname{Prefix}_{T(\\Xi)}(P)$，前缀与祖先保持见 [[56-df-position-slices]]、[[56-lem-slice-ancestor]]。$A_R,\\operatorname{NAll}_R,\\operatorname{NNone}_R,\\nu_{SR},\\operatorname{PWit}_R$ 见 [[56-df-needed-sr-measure]]。假设 $\\operatorname{NNone}_R(\\Pi,A_R(\\Xi,P))$ 与 $\\operatorname{NAll}_R(\\Xi,P)$。完整发展菱形见 [[56-thm-complete-development-diamond]]，置换及trace不变性见 [[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]、[[56-lem-trace-permutation]]。"},{"id":"68fa233ff6e9da6a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PT}_R,S_R,T_R,\\operatorname{Anc}_R$ 见 [[56-df-trace-ancestors]]；$\\operatorname{Slice},\\operatorname{Prefix},\\operatorname{Pattern}$ 见 [[56-df-position-slices]]。变量集记为 $\\mathcal V$，与有类型位置的顶点构造器 $V(p)$ 区分；假设 [[56-df-left-linear]] 的 $\\mathrm{LeftLinear}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)$，其中 $\\mathcal V$ 实例化该节点的变量集 $V$。$\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$，$s=S_R(\\phi)$，$t=T_R(\\phi)$，$P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(t)$。置换不变性和具体路径串行化分别见 [[56-lem-trace-permutation]]、[[56-lem-proofterm-serialization]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-position-slices.md]]"}],"outgoing":["450432a0e779ee1f"]}